{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "c3d4e5f6-a7b8-9012-cdef-123456789012",
    "name": "Baby Go — Provider Products",
    "description": "Creación y gestión de productos del provider.\n\n**Base:** {{baseUrl}} = http://localhost:3000/api\n**Auth:** Bearer {{token}} (login como `provider`)\n**Store:** 1:1 desde el token — no enviar `storeId`.\n\n**Flujo:** login provider → store creada → GET /products (listar) → POST /products → medias → save.\n\nGET /products y GET /products/:id son del dueño (token). Filtros: ?status= & ?category=\n\n`category` string libre. `attributes` objeto libre (opcional).\nCarpeta **1. Crear** tiene 15 bodies distintos para cargar catálogo de prueba.\nMáx 8 fotos, 5MB, PNG/JPEG/WEBP/GIF. Cloudinary: cada media trae `urls.original|thumbnail|card|detail` + width/height/format/bytes.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:3000/api"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "productId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "mediaId",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0. Ver mis productos",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Listar mis productos",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/products",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "products"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "status",
                  "value": "draft",
                  "disabled": true,
                  "description": "draft | active | inactive"
                },
                {
                  "key": "category",
                  "value": "bike",
                  "disabled": true
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Lista los productos de la store del token. Query opcional: status, category."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Obtener un producto",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/products/{{productId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "products",
                "{{productId}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Detalle de un producto propio. 404 si no existe o no es del provider."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
